{"step_index":260,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T18:46:03Z","content":"I have completed the development of the **Summarist v2** application! \n\nEverything builds and compiles cleanly into static and server-rendered routes without any warnings or compilation errors.\n\n### 📝 Review Completed Artifacts\n- **Task List**: Checked off all items in [task.md](file:///C:/Users/ambat/.gemini/antigravity/brain/c7e5dbbf-c810-4443-81c8-ce6c4ef145fb/task.md)\n- **Walkthrough**: Detailed summary of code architectures, mock service behaviors, page flows, and builds in [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/ambat/.gemini/antigravity/brain/c7e5dbbf-c810-4443-81c8-ce6c4ef145fb/walkthrough.md)\n\n### 🚀 Running the App Locally\nYou can run and test the app on your local system now!\n1. Start the Next.js development server:\n   ```bash\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n2. Open your browser and navigate to `http://localhost:3000`.\n\n### 🔍 Interactive Validation Tips\n1. **Landing Page (`/`)**: Click the headers in the **\"Enhance your knowledge\"** interactive section to verify the dynamic tabs update their metrics. Click **\"Login\"** to open the modal.\n2. **Dashboard (`/for-you`) & Skeletons**: Navigate inside. All lists will dynamically load from the real Cloud APIs and will pulse with skeleton loaders while fetching.\n3. **Debounced Search**: Start typing in the search bar. Notice it waits 300ms before making API calls, keeping requests efficient.\n4. **Playback & Confetti**: Go to a free book, click **\"Listen\"**, and press play. When the audio track finishes (ends), it will automatically dispatch a library action to mark it as **\"Finished\"** and trigger a full-screen **confetti celebration**!\n5. **Mock Payments & Upgrading**: Try to access a premium book summary. It will redirect you to `/choose-plan`. Once you choose a plan and upgrade, it will save your subscription state locally, granting you immediate access to all premium summaries!\n\nLet me know if you would like me to adjust any animations or add more custom styles!"}
